  "tip": "<p>When a question combines <i>global scale</i>, <i>strong consistency</i>, and <i>multi-region availability</i> with low write latency near users, map it to Spanner multi-region. If writes are limited to one region or replicas are read only, it is usually not the right fit.</p>",
